+ * this plugin returns from `load` never reaches ModuleInfo in the client dev path
+ * again (`_updateModuleInfo` only writes into entries that already exist). Every
+ * later hook here reads its input from exactly that meta, so without a fallback the
+ * image module stays empty and importing it fails with "doesn't provide an export
+ * named: 'default'". The loader records its input under the id Vite handed to it.
+ * Remove once load meta survives the client dev pipeline again.
+ */
